---

| Component | Responsibility | Current state |
|---|---|---|
| Work-unit queue | Priority, dependencies, retry, status | Interface/target |
| Router and scheduler | Eligibility, score, assignment, fallback | Simulated |
| Model registry | Capabilities, tools, health, data policy | Simulated |
| Context packager | Approved request, references, exact data, hashes, budgets | Deterministic local implementation |
| Execution manager | Provider-neutral HTTP/CLI invocation, timeout, normalized capture | Credential-gated engineering eval slice; business runtime remains simulated |
| Permission policy | Role/path/action allow, ask, deny | Deterministic gateway and Claude hook |
| Gate engine | Tests, schemas, policy, eval fixtures, build, scans | Repository CI definitions |
| Review panel | Risk 0–3 isolated lanes and finding adjudication | Deterministic local implementation |
| Audit/results store | Runs, usage, evidence, release identity | Append-only ignored local/CI files; no durable service |
| Human approval | Pause consequential actions | In-memory |
